   "fix": "Add `theorem measurableSet_iff {s : Set (Option X)} : MeasurableSet s \u2194 MeasurableSet (some \u207b\u00b9' s)` (no `none` condition is needed because `{none}` is measurable). Optionally add `measurableSet_range_some`.",
